# 🧠 TensorFlow & Deep Learning Course

A step-by-step **TensorFlow and Keras learning journey** covering neural-network classification, deep-learning regression, convolutional neural networks (CNNs), and real-world image classification.

This course is based on official TensorFlow tutorials and is structured with **beginner-friendly explanations, line-by-line code walkthroughs, hands-on practice, and mini projects**.

---

## 🎯 Course Objective

The goal of this course is to build a strong practical foundation in **TensorFlow, Keras, Deep Learning, and Computer Vision**.

By completing this course, I will learn how to:

* Build neural networks using TensorFlow/Keras
* Prepare and preprocess datasets
* Train, validate, and evaluate deep-learning models
* Understand loss functions and optimizers
* Perform classification and regression
* Build Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs)
* Work with image datasets
* Apply image normalization and augmentation
* Detect and reduce overfitting
* Make predictions using trained models
* Save and load TensorFlow models
* Build complete end-to-end deep-learning applications

